libtiffanydb (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First Debian/Ubuntu packaging of the Tiffany DB shared library.
  * Two binary packages: libtiffanydb1 (runtime) and libtiffanydb-dev
    (headers, static library, pkg-config). Both are Multi-Arch: same.
  * SONAME is libtiffanydb.so.1. Packaging did not bump the ABI and did not
    change the product version: 1.0.0 is the product, -1 is the Debian
    revision.
  * No tiffany-db package: the command line frontend does not exist yet and
    this packaging does not invent one.
  * Packaged from the committed sources only. The product sources are not
    modified by this package.

 -- Tiffany DB Maintainers <tiffanydb@example.invalid>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000